        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide components and services to the space economy, including spacecraft components, design services, and spacecraft-as-a-service from low Earth orbit to deep space and interplanetary missions.",
